<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Stellar Era - 140,000 tonnes coal Bolivar/Hadera 15-30/11 approx. $5.30 fio 40,000 shinc/20,000 shex NCSC.</p>
<p>ORE - Zodiac TBM - 150,000 tonnes Ponta da Madeira/Constanza 5-15/11 $5.50 fio three days shinc/30,000 shinc Coe and Clerici.</p>
<p>There were no fixtures reported from New York on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
